        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-02T18:31:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>How would you guys rule on this?</p><p>Fighting Voss. &nbsp;Ra had Imbued Fire out. &nbsp;All hero damage is fire, so we can't kill the Firesworn. &nbsp;Expatriette draws Liquid Nitrogen Rounds. &nbsp;Think that would work? &nbsp;I ruled yes.</p>",
